3OK.jpg","tmdbId":52001},{"name":"Richard D'Ovidio","character":"Richard D'Ovidio","photo":null,"tmdbId":57524},{"name":"Ryan Cruise","character":"Ryan Cruise","photo":null,"tmdbId":5853203}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTq2lnLXxotkI9BPnrwyA3LXA0E.jpg"]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt26862142:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Blue Skies","overview":"Fairbanks entra en confinamiento debo a una emergencia sin precedentes. Frank reúne los recursos disponibles para montar una respuesta a gran escala","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oVi82txNurQQK0nghDKGINaFW0Y.jpg","released":"2025-10-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"61 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Wind of Change","overview":"Luke trata de volver a casa mientras la búsqueda de Havlock se intensifica. Frank considera si debe ceder ante ciertas demandas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/blbOrV9ZfyA4E3lB1qYF3KAwDJE.jpg","released":"2025-10-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Country as F**k","overview":"La desaparición de Sarah agrega urgencia a la búsqueda de Frank. El plan maestro de Havlock da un giro inesperado aumentando el número de rehenes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/orl3lIpg3TJk7n7vlsaUZD51muD.jpg","released":"2025-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"62 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"American Dream","overview":"Un trooper desaparece, lo que amplía la investigación de Frank. Civiles armados se unen a la búsqueda. La preocupación de Sarah sobre el paradero de Luke aumenta.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3k9cfe8bDE0dRWj9jx3VmLHgmjU.jpg","released":"2025-10-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Arnaq","overview":"Frank se concentra en encontrar a Luke. La CIA se involucra más mientras el plan de Havlock entra a una nueva fase.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i7mUHOoGNPXwC6rMqLyhZhuqYI9.jpg","released":"2025-10-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"The Devil Wears a Suit and Tie","overview":"Fairbanks sufre un apagón. Sarah ve a alguien sospechoso en la sala de emergencias. Sidney trata de conseguir una pieza clave de evidencia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pR3vqxu8hZmbSqPdXXaMvoEUBUu.jpg","released":"2025-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Change of Time","overview":"Un nuevo sospechoso es interrogado. El secreto de Frank sale a la luz. Havlock intenta recuperar el contenido de su disco duro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bDsaIv8aklDyDoBXYLmKZO9QS3v.jpg","released":"2025-11-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"L’air Perdu","overview":"Sidney descubre más sobre el pasado de su padre, el protocolo Atwater y la información clasificada en el Archivo 6.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ziGycx8ZJVxxBJCuVza3n5csn2E.jpg","released":"2025-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Converge","overview":"Bradford aterriza en Fairbanks con un comando de la CIA y un nuevo objetivo. Sidney hace un intento desesperado por exponer la verdad.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uzDURDcNyWS7q9ifGNCgXbGmgBB.jpg","released":"2025-11-25T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt26862142:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Everything Trying","overview":"Sidney y Havlock arriesgan todo para recuperar el Archivo. Frank se embarca en una misión de socorro.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oIxPIgs38rTzZj3bvcQqIrvdQzn.jpg","released":"2025-12-04T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"}]}}